1
00:00:02,364 --> 00:00:04,065
The fact is,
he's the sponsor

2
00:00:04,132 --> 00:00:07,435
And you signed a contract
guaranteeing him
certain concessions,

3
00:00:07,503 --> 00:00:09,270
One of them being
a spot on the show.

4
00:00:09,338 --> 00:00:12,440
That's where I see things
just a little differently.

5
00:00:12,508 --> 00:00:16,878
Contract or no, I will
not bow to any sponsor.

6
00:00:16,946 --> 00:00:18,980
I'm sorry
you feel that way,

7
00:00:19,047 --> 00:00:21,248
But basically,
it's the nature
of the beast.

8
00:00:21,316 --> 00:00:23,250
Maybe I'm wrong
on this one,

9
00:00:23,318 --> 00:00:26,855
But for me, the beast
doesn't include selling out.

10
00:00:30,192 --> 00:00:32,794
Garth, you know what
I'm talking about,
right?

11
00:00:36,365 --> 00:00:40,334
It's, like, people
only do things
because they get paid,

12
00:00:40,402 --> 00:00:42,570
And that's
just really sad.

13
00:00:44,106 --> 00:00:47,842
I can't talk about it
anymore. It's giving me
a headache.

14
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:49,911
Here.
Take two of these.

15
00:00:52,615 --> 00:00:53,447
Ah. Nuprin.

16
00:00:53,515 --> 00:00:55,349
Little. Yellow.
Different.

17
00:00:55,417 --> 00:00:57,852
You can stay here
in the big leagues

18
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:59,521
And play by the rules

19
00:00:59,588 --> 00:01:02,156
Or go back to
the farm club in aurora.

20
00:01:02,224 --> 00:01:03,691
It's your choice.

21
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:07,261
Yes. And
it's the choice
of a new generation.

